config BR2_PACKAGE_TAB5_GPIO
	bool "Tab5 shell and MicroPython GPIO support"
	depends on BR2_riscv
	depends on !BR2_USE_MMU
	help
	  GPIO character-device v2 client restricted to selected Tab5 external
	  pins. Requires the matching isolated GPIO driver patch and GPIO_CDEV.
	  Builds tab5-gpio and enables tab5gpio.Pin when micropython-nommu is
	  selected. This option does not configure or drive any GPIO at boot.
